          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Where to keep the container's blocks between visits - cacheApiBlockStore() for the browser's own storage, or any ContainerBlockStore. Supplying one selects the block-wise path: the head is read first and only the blocks the store does not hold are fetched, so a revisit costs what actually changed. It replaces the whole-file cache entry rather than adding to it, since both hold the same bytes. Omit it to fetch and cache the file whole."
        }
